            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-simulate-data\">2. Simulate data</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Sample a path through the Markov chain using <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\pi||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(A||)</marimo-tex>, then\ndraw a noisy observation at each position from that state's\nGaussian. This gives us ground truth to check our algorithms\nagainst \u2014 a luxury real data never gives you.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
