          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"3-the-naive-baseline-classify-each-point-on-its-own\">3. The naive baseline: classify each point on its own</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">For every observation, just pick whichever state mean it's\nclosest to \u2014 no use of neighboring points at all. This is\nexactly the shape of a threshold, generalized to more than two\nclasses.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "emfo",
      "code_hash": "052cc2f59a36061a6570180993e336a9",
